    "Description": "Keystone is a Python implementation of the OpenStack\n(http://www.openstack.org) identity service API.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* OpenStack Keystone: Privilege escalation through EC2 credential creation\n(CVE-2026-33551)\n\n* OpenStack Keystone: Unauthenticated access to EC2/S3 token endpoints can grant Keystone authorization (CVE-2025-65073)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS\nscore, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE\npage listed in the References section.",
